v/t64.5771-25/491825503_2243360506203589_3026210163444295694_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zl0_l-f0FfYQ7kNvwGZLwRM&_nc_oc=Adp9l8Tvf6EwPLAufao6lnM0oVy_rOhFd5-gQMFXiiXgnUkfd6RDCqPv1Nm9kjjql8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFb07JpNi6WcYVu8zAbloJlMrGpaMahkyl2W_T1lXw7Pg&oe=6A81BC1B"}, {"file_name": "ss6.png", "id": "1758627601956255", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1758627605289588_7972355979608115924_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fwtAVCA-2pQQ7kNvwG7ZkP3&_nc_oc=Adrr7kdq5OK4EoAJgZgF0yFp4HXnRxcRZExfeSA3CMXzEsNN22-dZqqxxFodBlGRW8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHTIOCWRVsuSpLO6EGh8CqHyKz05E0kahtn9Arlb4TlTw&oe=6A81BD4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1920-B.png", "id": "2545709779195716", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_2545709782529049_2009155938216617446_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJWWw2qLef0Q7kNvwE7W3Kv&_nc_oc=AdqCh0p9sDgyDFUJ82yHIbiq2YCeXNzRvOFf_hoX5z2tgE1W1Qpme_AZWd9yu8Vk7l8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFkViFF2Aj1WgznnuyaPo4LcgzU0CUnFsRwbev5PhenYQ&oe=6A819C15"}, "display_name": "Stunt X Mania (SXM)", "keywords": ["Stunt", "Race", "Sports", "MotoX", "Racing"], "long_description": "Anyone can twist a throttle. Landing a Kiss of Death at full send is something else entirely.\n\n\ud83c\udfae VR Freestyle Motocross for Riders Who Want to Earn It\n\nStunt X Mania doesn't hand you highlights \u2014 it hands you a bike. Real clutch and gear mechanics, physics-driven handling, and a control system deep enough that your hundredth run feels nothing like your first. Auto gear makes it Easy.\n{1017577757790326}\n\ud83c\udfc6 12 Authentic FMX Stunts to Master\nEvery trick in the game comes from real FMX: Superman. Tsunami.  Cliff Hanger. Heel Clicker. Lazy Boy. One-Hand Heart Attack. 9 o'clock Nac. MC Metz,and more. Start with wheelies and endos. Work up to chaining stunts mid-air. The ceiling is high \n{1005387522297008}\n\ud83d\udd27 Make the Ride Yours\nStyle your rider and build your bike. Jackets, pants, helmets, engines, exhausts, and more \u2014 customize your avatar and machine until both look the way you ride.\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Three Ways to Ride\n\nCareer Mode \u2014 Climb the ranks lap by lap. Points, timers, and no shortcuts to the top.\nChallenges Mode \u2014 Specific objectives that expose the gaps in your game and make you close them.\nFree Roam \u2014 Your practice ground. No clock, no pressure \u2014 just reps until the trick is yours.\n\n\ud83c\udfa7 A Soundtrack Built for Flow State\nHigh-energy electronic tracks from our own indie crew \u2014 the kind of rhythm that keeps you locked in run after run.\n{1015450994446436}\n\ud83d\ude80 The Road Ahead\nCo-op sessions, competitive multiplayer lobbies, new stunts, and new arenas are coming. The riders putting in hours now will be the ones running the lobbies later. Get your reps in.", "short_description": "Feel the throttle in your hands and the arena floor drop away. Stunt X Mania is VR freestyle motocross with 12 real FMX tricks \u2014 Superman, Tsunami, Kiss of Death \u2014 20 arenas, and bike physics that make every landing earned. Hesitate and you eat dirt. Commit and you fly. Send it."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://revrgames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ReVR Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://revrgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area